[00:01.26]An island full of bananas,
{"一座满是香蕉的岛屿，"}
[00:03.66]a lovely nest for Slumbernanas!
{"斯伦伯纳纳的温馨巢穴！"}
[00:06.17]Eat bananas, nap the day away.
{"吃着香蕉，整日打盹。"}
[00:08.55]Worry no more, be happy every day!
{"不再忧虑，天天开心！"}
[00:11.86]Slumbernana Monkey is the very best,
{"斯伦伯纳纳猴子最棒，"}
[00:14.61]He's the monkey living life without a stress.
{"他是无忧无虑的猴子。"}
[00:16.76]人声 Vocal： Dorah Fine
